  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - BUSLAB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BUSLAB provides innovative transport solutions in Polokwane City. It aims at closing the gap by being an active lead supplier of alternative transport to people in the community. The companys strategy is to build a reputable market share by offering shared taxi as a viable alternative to existing taxicab services. BUSLAB will provide 3-wheelers Tuk-Tuk transport services utilizing computer dispatch to help with timely pick up and quality customer care. The software and hardware systems that will be used will give customers convenience by allowing them to use credit and debit cards in the taxi.</narrative>
  </description>
